		["Find desktop app automatically"] = "自动查找桌面端",
		["Find in this file"] = "在此文件中查找",
		["Find instances and read selected properties/attributes in one call. Name is a case-insensitive substring; class uses IsA. Stops as soon as a page fills, without collecting the entire subtree. Search is capped at 20,000 nodes."] = "一次调用中查找实例并读取选定的属性/特性。名称是大小写不敏感的子串；类名使用 IsA。填满一页即停止，不收集整棵子树。搜索上限 20,000 个节点。",
		["Find remotes in the place, with how many client-side listeners each has when the host can tell."] = "查找场景中的远程调用，并在宿主可判断时给出每个的客户端监听数。",
		["Find text"] = "查找文本",
		["Find tools hidden by the active tool profile. action=list returns names and one-line descriptions; action=describe returns a tool's exact schema pages; action=call runs that tool with its declared arguments. Hidden tools keep their normal permissions and conversation scope. Core tools are already declared; use this only when the needed tool is absent."] = "查找被当前工具档案隐藏的工具。action=list 返回名称与一行说明；action=describe 返回工具的完整 schema 分页；action=call 以声明的参数运行该工具。隐藏工具保持原有权限与对话范围。核心工具已声明，仅在缺少所需工具时使用。",
		["Find your bearings in the world."] = "先弄清楚这个世界的结构。",
		["Find your way around"] = "熟悉界面",
		["Find · Ctrl+F"] = "查找 · Ctrl+F",
		["Fire a RemoteEvent to the server. This is a real server call: it can change the game and can be logged or punished by anticheat. Prefix an argument with a type when it is not a plain string or number, e.g. 'vec3:0, 10, 0' or 'instance:Workspace.Door'."] = "向服务器触发 RemoteEvent。这是真实的服务器调用：可能改变游戏，也可能被反作弊记录或惩罚。参数不是普通字符串或数字时请加类型前缀，例如 'vec3:0, 10, 0' 或 'instance:Workspace.Door'。",
		["Folder name"] = "文件夹名称",
		["Follow the work, inspect its output, and continue the same context."] = "跟进任务、查看输出，并在同一上下文中继续。",
		["Follow-ups run in this order after the current response or tool batch. Your draft stays in the composer, and the active turn is never interrupted."] = "追问会按此顺序在当前回复或工具批次之后执行。草稿仍留在输入框，当前回合不会被打断。",
		["Follow-ups run in this order after the current response or tool batch. Your draft stays in the composer, and the active turn keeps running."] = "追问会按此顺序在当前回复或工具批次之后执行。草稿仍留在输入框，当前回合继续运行。",
		["Forget everything"] = "忘记全部",
		["Free routes need no card. Paid routes need a key or credit. Local servers run on your machine. Pick any of them and every field stays editable."] = "免费线路无需银行卡；付费线路需要密钥或余额；本地服务器运行在你自己的机器上。任选一种，所有字段都仍可编辑。",
		["Full configuration"] = "完整配置",
