		["Go to line…"] = "跳转到行…",
		-- h
		["Hard ceiling on tokens kept before older turns are summarised. When the model's context window is known, compaction begins at the Compact-at fraction of it, so this mainly caps models with very large or unknown windows."] = "保留 Token 的硬上限，超过后较早的回合会被汇总。已知模型上下文窗口时，压缩从该窗口的「压缩触发点」比例开始，因此这一项主要约束窗口极大或未知的模型。",
		["Hidden"] = "隐藏",
		["Hide context details"] = "隐藏上下文详情",
		["Home"] = "主页",
		["Host a quiz in Roblox chat: ask questions, detect the first correct player answer, keep scores, reveal unanswered answers, and repeat. Supply questions and answers. Returns a managed loop ID."] = "在 Roblox 聊天中主持测验：提问、判定首位答对的玩家、计分、公布无人答出的答案并重复。需提供题目与答案。返回受管理的循环 ID。",
		["How a fenced code block is drawn, in the transcript and everywhere else. Press one to use it."] = "围栏代码块的呈现方式，适用于对话与其他所有位置。点击即可选用。",
		["How many levels of subagent are allowed. A subagent given the full tool set can dispatch its own; at 0 the agent cannot dispatch at all and does the work in the conversation instead. The Subagents panel lists what is running under these limits."] = "允许的子代理层级。拿到完整工具集的子代理还能继续派发；设为 0 时完全不能派发，改为在对话里自己完成。子代理面板会列出这些限制下正在运行的任务。",
		-- i
		["INFERENCE PROVIDERS"] = "推理提供商",
		["Identify the current place: name, IDs, creator, live player counts and uptime. Product metadata is cached for 60 seconds; refresh=true bypasses it."] = "识别当前场景：名称、ID、创作者、在线玩家数与运行时长。产品元数据缓存 60 秒；refresh=true 可绕过。",
		["Ignore the step limit and the fifteen-minute turn deadline, and keep calling tools until the answer is written. The repeat breaker, each tool's own timeout and Stop still apply, and subagents keep their own budgets."] = "忽略步数上限与 15 分钟回合时限，持续调用工具直到写出答案。重复检测、各工具自身的超时和「停止」仍然生效，子代理保留各自的预算。",
		["Import & export"] = "导入与导出",
