		["Inspect retained value"] = "查看保留的值",
		["Inspect the connected Project Gravity engine, selected shape, targets, held part count and settings. Reports when Gravity is not loaded."] = "查看已连接的 Project Gravity 引擎、当前形状、目标、持有部件数与设置。未加载时如实报告。",
		["Inspect up to 20 known instance paths at once. Select only the properties and attributes needed; compact class defaults are used otherwise. Missing paths do not discard successful reads."] = "一次查看最多 20 个已知实例路径。只选择需要的属性与特性；否则使用紧凑的类默认值。缺失路径不会丢弃成功读取的部分。",
		["Inspect value"] = "查看值",
		["Install Node.js 18+ on this computer. Download the files, then open a terminal in your executor workspace (the folder containing UAI). Run: node UAI/bridge/start.txt"] = "在此电脑上安装 Node.js 18+。下载文件后，在执行器工作区（包含 UAI 的文件夹）打开终端，运行：node UAI/bridge/start.txt",
		["Interface font"] = "界面字体",
		["Invoke a RemoteFunction and return what the server answers. Blocks until it replies, and can hang if the server never does."] = "调用 RemoteFunction 并返回服务器答复。会阻塞直到回复；服务器不回复时可能一直挂起。",
