		["Ko-fi copies its link, which you can open in a browser."] = "Ko-fi 会复制链接，你可以用浏览器打开。",
		["Ko-fi link copied"] = "Ko-fi 链接已复制",
		-- l
		["Language"] = "语言",
		["Large keeps only results at or above 8 KiB for later recovery; source and file tools are already durable. All keeps every result; Off writes nothing."] = "「大型」只保留 8 KiB 及以上的结果以便回查；源码与文件工具本身已持久化。「全部」保留所有结果；「关闭」不写入任何内容。",
