		["Latest run"] = "最近一次运行",
		["Launcher reset"] = "启动按钮已重置",
		["Layout"] = "布局",
		["Layout follows the viewport by default. Pin it if you would rather it did not."] = "布局默认跟随视口变化。若想固定，可在此锁定。",
		["Let a dispatched subagent run with no step limit or clock while its parent continues working. The repeat breaker, each tool's timeout, the ceilings below and Stop still apply. The Subagents panel can stop one child, and ending the parent turn stops unfinished children."] = "让已派发的子代理不受步数与时间限制，同时父级继续工作。重复检测、各工具超时、下方各项上限和「停止」仍然生效。子代理面板可停止单个子代理，结束父回合会停止未完成的子代理。",
		["Line number"] = "行号",
		["List instances carrying a CollectionService tag, or list every tag in use."] = "列出带有某个 CollectionService 标签的实例，或列出所有在用的标签。",
		["List managed chat loops and independent chatbots, progress, failures, and quiz scores."] = "列出受管理的聊天循环与独立聊天机器人、进度、失败与测验得分。",
		["List script instances in the place, with their paths. Useful for finding where behaviour lives before reading it."] = "列出场景中的脚本实例及其路径。适合在阅读前定位行为所在。",
		["List the ready-made script templates this client ships with. A template is a pre-written tool invocation for a common job -- player distances, ESP, FPS statistics, remote automation. Call with no arguments for the index; pass an id for one template's full detail."] = "列出本客户端内置的现成脚本模板。模板是针对常见任务的预写工具调用——玩家距离、ESP、FPS 统计、远程自动化。无参数调用获取索引；传 id 获取某个模板的完整详情。",
		["List this user's other conversations for review, most recent first, each with its id, title, place, age, size and opening request. Use it to triage which past thread is relevant, then read that one with conversation_read. Untouched empty chats are omitted; the current conversation is marked and does not need reading. Query filters on the title or the opening request."] = "列出该用户的其他对话以便回顾，最近优先，含 id、标题、场景、时间、大小与开场请求。用于判断哪条线索相关，再用 conversation_read 读取。空对话会被省略；当前对话会被标记且无需读取。查询按标题或开场请求过滤。",
		["Listen to a RemoteEvent and report the next few things the server sends through it. Useful for learning a remote's argument shape before firing it."] = "监听 RemoteEvent，并报告服务器接下来通过它发送的几条内容。适合在触发前了解参数形态。",
		["Listen to any instance signal for a short window and report what fired, with argument shapes. Unlike remote_watch this works on ordinary RBXScriptSignals -- Touched, Changed, ChildAdded, MouseButton1Click -- so a game's wiring can be understood without firing anything at the server."] = "在短时间窗口内监听任意实例信号，并报告触发情况与参数形态。与 remote_watch 不同，它适用于普通 RBXScriptSignal——Touched、Changed、ChildAdded、MouseButton1Click——因此无需向服务器发任何东西就能理解游戏的接线方式。",
		["Ln "] = "行 ",
		["Load more children…"] = "加载更多子项…",
		["Load more files…"] = "加载更多文件…",
		["Load more remotes…"] = "加载更多远程调用…",
		["Load more…"] = "加载更多…",
		["Load older calls…"] = "加载更早的调用…",
		["Log cleared"] = "日志已清除",
		["Logs"] = "日志",
		["Logs & traces"] = "日志与追踪",
		["Longest streak"] = "最长连续",
		["Look up a Roblox place or asset by positive id. Native product metadata is cached for 60 seconds; refresh=true bypasses it. HTTP is a fallback when native lookup fails."] = "按正整数 id 查询 Roblox 场景或资产。原生产品元数据缓存 60 秒；refresh=true 可绕过。原生查询失败时回退到 HTTP。",
		["Low is the faster default; raise it for difficult tasks. Existing saved choices are kept. Sent as the provider's effort level where supported; raw provider parameters can override it. Provider default omits the effort field and may still think extensively. The Thinking row shows visible text, not a 5,999-token limit."] = "Low 是更快的默认值；难任务再调高。已保存的选择会保留。支持时作为提供商的 effort 级别发送；原始提供商参数可以覆盖它。选「提供商默认」会省略该字段，模型仍可能大量思考。Thinking 行显示的是可见文本，不是 5,999 Token 的额度。",
		["Lower is steadier; 0 is as deterministic as the provider allows. The current Claude models reject it, and it is not sent to them."] = "越低越稳定；0 是提供商允许范围内最确定的取值。当前 Claude 模型不接受它，因此不会发送。",
		-- m
		["Manage providers"] = "管理提供商",
		["Manual bridge enabled"] = "启用手动桥接",
		["Manual connection"] = "手动连接",
		["Manual setup: download and start"] = "手动配置：下载并启动",
		["Markdown displayed as plain text"] = "Markdown 已按纯文本显示",
		["Match the port printed in the terminal, paste its Token, then turn Enabled on above. After restarting the bridge, paste the new token and reopen its browser link."] = "与终端打印的端口保持一致，粘贴其 Token，然后在上方启用。重启桥接后，请粘贴新令牌并重新打开浏览器链接。",
		["Matches a title, a message or a reply. %{count} on this client."] = "匹配标题、消息或回复。本客户端共 %{count} 个对话。",
		["Maximum bytes kept from one tool result. A tool's own page limit can be smaller. Roughly four bytes per token for English text; code and Unicode vary."] = "单个工具结果保留的最大字节数。工具自身分页上限可能更小。英文约每 Token 四字节；代码与 Unicode 会有出入。",
		["Maximum generated tokens per request, including reasoning where the provider counts it. Model limits, available context and learned provider caps may lower it. This does not require the model to use the whole allowance."] = "每次请求最多生成的 Token，包含提供商计入的推理。模型限制、可用上下文与学到的提供商上限可能把它压低。这不要求模型用满额度。",
		["Maximum request wait"] = "请求最长等待",
		["Measure frame rate over a short sample and report memory and network stats."] = "短时采样帧率，并报告内存与网络统计。",
		["Menus, the sidebar and the transcript. Only the families this client can actually load are listed -- the list is probed against the engine rather than declared, so it is shorter on an older client than a longer one."] = "菜单、侧栏与对话区使用的字体。这里只列出客户端实际能加载的字族——列表是向引擎探测得到的，所以在旧客户端上会更短。",
		["Message UAI…"] = "给 UAI 发消息…",
