		["Pause for a few seconds before continuing, to let something in the game settle or a change take effect."] = "暂停几秒再继续，让游戏中的状态稳定或让改动生效。",
		["Peak hour"] = "高峰时段",
		["Per-provider switches. Each one can only narrow what the matching global setting allows: turning one off always takes effect, turning it on needs the global on as well."] = "按提供商单独开关。它们只能在全局设置允许的范围内收窄：关闭总是生效，开启则需要全局也开启。",
		["Permissions"] = "权限",
		["Pick a provider from the list"] = "从列表中挑选提供商",
		["Pick a route to fill in its URL, protocol and auth style. Every field stays editable, and nothing is saved until you say so."] = "选择一条线路以填入 URL、协议与认证方式。所有字段仍可编辑，未确认前不会保存。",
		["Place details"] = "场景详情",
		["Plugins"] = "插件",
		["Press, hold or release a keyboard key. Holds belong to this conversation and release on up, cancellation or unload. Accepted/uncertain presses are never repeated through a fallback; after a release failure, use only action=up."] = "按下、长按或释放键盘按键。长按属于本对话，会在抬起、取消或卸载时释放。已接受或结果不确定的按键绝不通过回退重发；释放失败后只使用 action=up。",
