		["Remove input"] = "移除输入项",
		["Remove last interior keypoint"] = "移除最后一个内部关键点",
		["Remove these %{count} follow-ups. The active response keeps running."] = "将移除 %{count} 条追问，当前回复会继续运行。",
		["Rename folder"] = "重命名文件夹",
		["Rename script"] = "重命名脚本",
		["Rename this conversation"] = "重命名此对话",
		["Rename this conversation to a short, specific title based on what it is actually about, so the user can pick the thread out of their list later. Call it once the subject is clear -- usually after the first exchange -- and again only when the work has genuinely moved on. Name the job, not the tools used. Never use it to replace a name the user set themselves; a conversation the user has named is not offered this tool."] = "依据对话的真实内容，把它重命名为简短明确的标题，便于用户以后在列表中辨认。主题清晰后调用一次——通常在第一轮交流之后——只有工作确实转向时才再次调用。命名任务本身，而不是所用工具。绝不要用它替换用户自己设置的名字；用户已命名的对话不会提供此工具。",
		["Reparent an instance."] = "更改实例的父级。",
		["Replace the full task list. Use when substantial work benefits from a tracked plan; keep one item active while work remains. Routine tool sequences need no list."] = "替换完整任务列表。当工作较大且需要跟踪计划时使用；只要还有工作，就保持一项处于进行中。常规的工具序列不需要列表。",
		["Replace with another type"] = "替换为其他类型",
		["Replay draft"] = "重放草稿",
		["Replay once"] = "重放一次",
		["Reply ceiling"] = "回复上限",
		["Reply language"] = "回复语言",
		["Reply ready"] = "回复已就绪",
		["Report Infinite Yield: the Settings mode, whether it is loaded, how it was obtained (already running, or loaded by this client), the command count and prefix. This inspection does not load IY; command tools ensure availability themselves."] = "报告 Infinite Yield：设置中的模式、是否已加载、来源（已在运行或由本客户端加载）、命令数量与前缀。此查看不会加载 IY；命令类工具会自行确保可用。",
		["Report the agent's own state: provider, model, token spend this session, context size, host capabilities and how many tools are available."] = "报告代理自身状态：提供商、模型、本次会话 Token 消耗、上下文大小、宿主能力与可用工具数量。",
