		["Roblox will move you to the Project Ptolemy donation place. "] = "Roblox 会把你传送到 Project Ptolemy 捐赠场景。",
		["Roblox will move you to the Project Ptolemy donation place. Your conversations and settings are saved before you leave."] = "Roblox 会把你传送到 Project Ptolemy 捐赠场景。离开前会保存你的对话和设置。",
