		["Submit a ClickDetector, ProximityPrompt hold, or part touch interaction. Prompt/touch holds are released on cancellation or unload; host acceptance does not prove a server response."] = "提交 ClickDetector、ProximityPrompt 长按或部件触摸交互。提示/触摸长按会在取消或卸载时释放；宿主接受不代表服务器已响应。",
