		["The model picks one of these per dispatch. 'read' is the default and cannot change anything; a delegated write is hard to attribute afterwards, which is why it has to be asked for."] = "模型每次派发时从中选择一个。'read' 是默认值，不能修改任何内容；被委派的写入事后很难归因，所以必须显式申请。",
		["The monospace family for code and diagnostics. Roblox renders from a fixed set of families, so this offers the ones that exist rather than a box to type a font name into that could not be loaded."] = "代码与诊断信息使用的等宽字体。Roblox 只能渲染固定的字族集合，因此这里提供已存在的字族，而不是一个可以输入字体名却无法加载的输入框。",
		["The provider cut off this tool batch at its token limit. No calls in this batch ran. Send smaller complete calls; split large scripts into sequential file_write/file_append calls or targeted file_edit edits."] = "提供商在 Token 上限处截断了这批工具调用，本批次没有任何调用执行。请改为更小的完整调用；把大脚本拆成多次 file_write/file_append，或使用定向的 file_edit。",
		["The same value as the text scale under General."] = "与「常规」中的文字缩放是同一个值。",
